WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.566 --> 00:00:07.766
Pikachu! Pika! Pika!

2
00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:10.200
- Pika! Pika!
- Pikachu!

3
00:00:10.266 --> 00:00:13.633
- Pikachu, don't give up!
- Ash! Be quiet!

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.766
- Uh...
- Pika, pi.

5
00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:18.233
Cut! Cut! Hey!

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.433
Pika-quiet on the set!

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.866
Sorry about that.

8
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:26.466
Now, then, let's get back to it, pika-pronto!

9
00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:30.900
Scene 21. Ready? Action!

10
00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:32.766
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

11
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.533
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

12
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.966
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

13
00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:39.433
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

14
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.266
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

15
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.533
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

16
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.966
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

17
00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:53.933
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

18
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.633
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

19
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.966
♪ Pokémon! ♪

20
00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:04.266
Lights! Camera! Pika!

21
00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.266
While Ash dreams of entering the Kalos League,

22
00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:11.000
our heroes continue their journey.

23
00:01:11.066 --> 00:01:12.866
Suddenly...

24
00:01:16.866 --> 00:01:20.866
Pi, pika, pi! Pi, pika, pi!

25
00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:24.933
Pi, pika, pi! Pi, pika, pi!

26
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.733
What's going on?

27
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.466
-Pika, pika!

28
00:01:28.533 --> 00:01:31.733
- Look at all those Pikachu!
- Denne-ne.

29
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.266
- What is this place. anyway?
- Pi, pika, pi! Pi, pika, pi!

30
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.733
They look like they're having so much fun!

31
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.200
- Pika, pika!
- Pi, pika, pi!

32
00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:41.733
- Maybe it's a Pikachu party!
- Denne-ne!

33
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:44.900
All right, Pikachu! Let's go see what it's all about.

34
00:01:44.966 --> 00:01:46.666
- Pikachu!
- Me, too!

35
00:01:46.733 --> 00:01:48.666
- Hey, wait up!
- Don't run!

36
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.166
Pi, pika, pi!

37
00:01:50.233 --> 00:01:52.133
- Pika, pika!
- Pi, pika, pi!

38
00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.766
- What's this?
- Pi, pika, pi!

39
00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:56.800
- Such fluid movements.
- Pi, pika, pi!

40
00:01:56.866 --> 00:01:59.733
- Pi, pika, pi!
- Pika! Pika! Pika!

41
00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.466
That perfectly pika-proportioned body!

42
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:05.700
Pika, pika!

43
00:02:05.766 --> 00:02:09.333
That Pikachu grabbed the other Pikachus' attention in less than an instant!

44
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.700
Now that's incredible pika-star power!

45
00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:15.533
OK, everybody, wanna have some fun?

46
00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.000
Pika! Pika!

47
00:02:17.066 --> 00:02:18.433
- Cut! Cut!
- Pika?

48
00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.333
I've never seen anything like it, ever!

49
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.533
Is that your pika-Pikachu?

50
00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:28.333
- Uh, yeah.
- I pika-love it!

51
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.633
- Mr Director?
- Uh, director?

52
00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:36.366
I want your fantabulous Pikachu to star in the lead role in my pika-movie!

53
00:02:36.433 --> 00:02:39.433
Uh! Lead role? You mean my Pikachu?

54
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.633
- Pikachu?
- A movie?

55
00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.933
That's so cool, Pikachu!

56
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.800
- Say pika-yes, Pikachu!
- Pika?

57
00:02:45.866 --> 00:02:48.533
- My pika-Pikachu star.
- Pi. Pika!

58
00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.533
You'll make my pika-movie shine with your pika-star power!

59
00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:55.033
Pikachu!

60
00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.000
- Pika-fantastic.
- Huh?

61
00:02:59.066 --> 00:03:00.833
Pi.

62
00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.700
This is Pikachu Manor,

63
00:03:02.766 --> 00:03:06.300
my pika-palatial estate that I'm quite pika-proud of!

64
00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:08.233
With a gazillion Pikachu!

65
00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.933
My name is Frank.

66
00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.800
Nobody in the world loves Pikachu more than pika-me!

67
00:03:13.866 --> 00:03:17.066
My name's Ash. And this is my partner Pikachu.

68
00:03:17.133 --> 00:03:19.100
- Pikachu.
- I'm Serena.

69
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:21.833
I'm Bonnie. And this is Dedenne.

70
00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.600
- Denne.
- And this is my big brother!

71
00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:25.666
I'm Clemont.

72
00:03:25.733 --> 00:03:29.500
I'm Jean, and I basically help out my grandfather.

73
00:03:29.566 --> 00:03:30.400
Hi, there!

74
00:03:30.466 --> 00:03:32.633
I thank you from the bottom of my heart

75
00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.533
for accepting the lead role in my movie, Pikachu.

76
00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.766
- Pika, pika.
- The lead, huh?

77
00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:40.933
- Can we help out too?
- Yeah, I wanna make a movie!

78
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.933
- Denne-ne.
- Me, too!

79
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.900
- It would certainly be a lot of fun.
- Yeah, please!

80
00:03:45.966 --> 00:03:49.933
- Sure! A pika-pleasure, indeed!
- That's so nice!

81
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.666
Then allow me to introduce all of you to my pika-movie stars.

82
00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:58.033
Everyone! Please, come in in full pika-costume!

83
00:04:01.466 --> 00:04:03.866
Pikachu Pop Star!

84
00:04:03.933 --> 00:04:05.233
Pika, pika!

85
00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.300
Pikachu Rock Star!

86
00:04:07.366 --> 00:04:10.233
Pika! Pikachu!

87
00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.066
Pikachu, PhD!

88
00:04:13.133 --> 00:04:14.733
Pika, pika! Pikachu!

89
00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.833
Pikachu Libre!

90
00:04:16.899 --> 00:04:19.500
Pika! Pikachu! Pika!

91
00:04:19.566 --> 00:04:21.266
Pikachu Belle.

92
00:04:21.333 --> 00:04:24.100
Pika. Pika, Pikachu!

93
00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:25.633
- Wow.
- Pika!

94
00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.400
They all look so cute in their costumes!

95
00:04:27.466 --> 00:04:30.100
- Like real movie stars!
- Yeah, yeah!

96
00:04:30.166 --> 00:04:34.866
Your Pikachu's perfect for the lead role in my pika-movie.

97
00:04:34.933 --> 00:04:39.100
So let's work as a team! And make it a pika-blockbuster!

98
00:04:39.166 --> 00:04:40.333
- Yeah!
- Pika!

99
00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:44.700
Feast your eyes on the script!

100
00:04:44.766 --> 00:04:46.133
The script, huh?

101
00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:49.000
It contains every detail of all the characters' actions

102
00:04:49.066 --> 00:04:50.833
and all of their lines as well.

103
00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.233
- Hold on.
- Clemont, what's up?

104
00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.500
It's the script. There are only three pages written.

105
00:04:56.566 --> 00:04:57.766
The rest are blank!

106
00:04:57.833 --> 00:05:00.266
So, does that mean...

107
00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.433
Pika.

108
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.100
The script as of yet is unfinished.

109
00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:07.166
- Say what?
- But I already know the pika-plot.

110
00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:09.900
I just haven't put pen to pika-paper yet!

111
00:05:09.966 --> 00:05:12.266
How do you work without a script?

112
00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:14.533
With my pika-passion for movie making,

113
00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:18.233
and my pika-love for Pikachu, it's a cinch!

114
00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:22.066
- Pika.
- You're a genius! So cool!

115
00:05:22.133 --> 00:05:25.500
Oh! You're so sweet to think so highly of me, pika-Bonnie!

116
00:05:25.566 --> 00:05:28.600
- A truly nice thing to say!
- Yay!

117
00:05:28.666 --> 00:05:30.533
Of course.

118
00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:34.433
That can only mean the future is now, thanks to science!

119
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.166
Clemontic Brain, on! I'll complete your script!

120
00:05:38.233 --> 00:05:42.066
- Oh, for little old pika-me?
- That's my big brother!

121
00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:45.233
- Pika, Pikachu.
- Pika, Pikachu.

122
00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.233
- Pika, Pikachu!
- Pikachu.

123
00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.300
Pika!

124
00:05:49.366 --> 00:05:51.566
- Uh...
- Pikachu!

125
00:05:51.633 --> 00:05:55.433
We're counting on you! And together, we'll make a pika-blockbuster!

126
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.400
- Pika! Pika!
- All right?

127
00:05:57.466 --> 00:06:01.133
Ready? This will be a pika-superhero movie.

128
00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.500
Thus begins the story...

129
00:06:03.566 --> 00:06:05.533
Pikachuland is having a festival,

130
00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:09.200
when the evil Pikachu Libre suddenly mounts a pikattack!

131
00:06:09.266 --> 00:06:13.266
Pikachu PhD and Pikachu Rock Star battle Pikachu Libre,

132
00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:16.033
but the entire ordeal ends in pika-defeat.

133
00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:20.033
And that's when Super-Pikachu arrives to save the day, right?

134
00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:24.533
Right. And Pikachuland is safe once again, thanks to Super-Pikachu!

135
00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:28.233
But the hero in a superhero movie needs to lose at least once.

136
00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.333
Oh. We'll use that brilliant pika-plan!

137
00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.966
This story is getting better by the minute!

138
00:06:34.033 --> 00:06:36.866
- Yes! Such pika-citement!

139
00:06:41.166 --> 00:06:45.000
Thanks so much for helping my grandfather realise his dream.

140
00:06:45.066 --> 00:06:46.600
It's fun!

141
00:06:46.666 --> 00:06:49.500
Sure is! Your grandfather really loves Pikachu.

142
00:06:49.566 --> 00:06:50.733
Hm.

143
00:06:51.766 --> 00:06:52.900
Very much.

144
00:06:52.966 --> 00:06:54.166
He always told me

145
00:06:54.233 --> 00:06:57.266
there was a Pikachu by his side ever since he was a kid.

146
00:06:59.866 --> 00:07:01.300
He's a bit unusual.

147
00:07:01.366 --> 00:07:05.266
But his love for Pikachu is stronger than anyone else I've ever met!

148
00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:10.000
And that's why I really want to help make my grandfather's dream come true.

149
00:07:10.066 --> 00:07:14.100
Your help means so very much to me. Thank you so much!

150
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:16.800
You really care about your grandfather, don't you?

151
00:07:16.866 --> 00:07:18.500
- Hm.
- Awesome!

152
00:07:18.566 --> 00:07:20.866
We'll make it work, no matter what!

153
00:07:20.933 --> 00:07:22.100
Pika.

154
00:07:27.566 --> 00:07:30.700
How to make a Pikachu movie!

155
00:07:30.766 --> 00:07:33.500
Ready? Action!

156
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.833
This camera's ready to roll!

157
00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:42.600
- Standing by with sound!
- Gurdurr.

158
00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:45.133
- Lights ready?
- Helio.

159
00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:49.266
- Smoke?
- Weezing, ready to go?

160
00:07:49.333 --> 00:07:51.100
- Weezing!
- Whoa.

161
00:07:51.166 --> 00:07:54.000
- Everyone ready to rock?
- Denne.

162
00:07:54.066 --> 00:07:55.100
Pika!

163
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:58.033
Are you sure you wanna shoot way down here?

164
00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:01.266
It's pika-perfect! As long as we have those blue screens,

165
00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:05.766
we can transform it into a dramatic background later using pika-CGI.

166
00:08:05.833 --> 00:08:07.666
Wow! Yay!

167
00:08:07.733 --> 00:08:09.800
We're all set to roll here!

168
00:08:09.866 --> 00:08:11.266
- Braixen.
- Torkoal.

169
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:13.733
Let's get to the pika-production.

170
00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.166
Ready... action!

171
00:08:19.466 --> 00:08:23.166
- Pika, pika.
- Pi, pika, pika!

172
00:08:23.233 --> 00:08:24.966
Pika, pika!

173
00:08:25.033 --> 00:08:26.600
- Pika!
- Pika?

174
00:08:29.033 --> 00:08:30.833
Pika. Pika, pika!

175
00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.566
All right, cue lightning!

176
00:08:32.633 --> 00:08:34.466
- OK, go!
- Denne-ne!

177
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:38.100
Pika, pika!

178
00:08:38.166 --> 00:08:42.100
- Gurdurr! Raise the microphone higher!
- Gurdurr.

179
00:08:43.133 --> 00:08:46.833
- Quick! We need more smoke!
- Wee...

180
00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.966
- And cut!
- Huh?

181
00:08:49.033 --> 00:08:50.833
Hey, what are you doing, Serena?

182
00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.333
Documenting. Behind the scenes!

183
00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:55.833
So what's happening next?

184
00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:59.566
The next scene we're filming with Pikachu could get a little dangerous.

185
00:08:59.633 --> 00:09:02.700
To be safe, we're using a stunt double.

186
00:09:02.766 --> 00:09:05.366
- Ready to go, Hawlucha?
- Lucha!

187
00:09:05.433 --> 00:09:09.866
Camera rolling! And... action!

188
00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:12.066
Cha-lu!

189
00:09:12.133 --> 00:09:13.933
- Koal!
- Braix!

190
00:09:15.733 --> 00:09:18.966
- Ha-cha! Cha-lu.
- Pika.

191
00:09:19.033 --> 00:09:21.566
Pika!

192
00:09:21.633 --> 00:09:25.766
- And cut! Pika-perfection!
- Pikachu!

193
00:09:26.733 --> 00:09:29.566
- Awesome, Hawlucha!
- Cha-lu-ha.

194
00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:43.866
At the moment, the whole crew is on break.

195
00:09:43.933 --> 00:09:45.966
for a little bite to eat!

196
00:09:48.233 --> 00:09:51.900
Wow! Your Pikachu is a true pika-pro!

197
00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:54.966
It's obvious that you've raised it pika-perfectly.

198
00:09:55.033 --> 00:09:56.566
Thanks a lot, Frank!

199
00:09:56.633 --> 00:09:58.966
-Pika, pika.

200
00:09:59.033 --> 00:10:01.366
Those two sure are embarrassed.

201
00:10:01.433 --> 00:10:03.966
Now, let's interview the director.

202
00:10:04.033 --> 00:10:07.033
Frank, how did you come to love Pikachu so much?

203
00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.500
Your thoughts, please.

204
00:10:09.566 --> 00:10:13.166
Pikachu have always been a part of my life.

205
00:10:13.233 --> 00:10:16.966
Why, I can't talk about me without talking about Pikachu!

206
00:10:17.033 --> 00:10:21.566
You see, I was always sick when I was a young child.

207
00:10:21.633 --> 00:10:24.500
But somehow, Pikachu managed to help keep my spirits up!

208
00:10:24.566 --> 00:10:26.133
-Pika.

209
00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:30.600
Whenever I cried, Pikachu was always there to comfort me.

210
00:10:30.666 --> 00:10:35.200
When I was a young lad around your age, we travelled together, like you do.

211
00:10:35.266 --> 00:10:38.433
We laughed together. We struggled together.

212
00:10:40.366 --> 00:10:43.966
And shared much happiness together!

213
00:10:44.033 --> 00:10:48.666
When I found myself in despair, Pikachu was always there for me.

214
00:10:48.733 --> 00:10:52.500
Pikachu brought me more smiles than I could ever mention.

215
00:10:53.533 --> 00:10:58.200
That's why I want to share all of those smiles with children around the world

216
00:10:58.266 --> 00:10:59.633
through my movie.

217
00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.266
This is my dream.

218
00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:03.200
Pikachu!

219
00:11:03.266 --> 00:11:04.766
Mm-hm.

220
00:11:05.933 --> 00:11:09.300
It'll be great! Everyone'll love it! No doubt!

221
00:11:09.366 --> 00:11:10.566
Pikachu!

222
00:11:10.633 --> 00:11:12.966
- Mm-hm.
- Denne, denne, denne!

223
00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:26.333
And cut!

224
00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:29.966
We've got every scene safely in the can! It's a pika-wrap!

225
00:11:30.033 --> 00:11:31.400
- All right!
- Yay! Yay!

226
00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:34.700
-Pika.

227
00:11:34.766 --> 00:11:36.200
- Magne.
- Gurdurr.

228
00:11:36.266 --> 00:11:40.233
Now, all that's left is editing the film in post-production.

229
00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.733
And, of course, adding glorious sound!

230
00:12:00.566 --> 00:12:02.833
Folks, we've got ourselves a movie!

231
00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:06.766
-Pika!

232
00:12:06.833 --> 00:12:12.333
Lightning fast! Brave and strong! Super-Pikachu!

233
00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:17.833
Thanks to everyone's help, my movie is finally a pika-reality!

234
00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:22.833
I hope you will thoroughly enjoy our pika-preview.

235
00:12:30.966 --> 00:12:34.900
Pika!

236
00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.733
This is Pikachuland.

237
00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.033
A beautiful, peaceful little town,

238
00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:47.533
built and inhabited by a happy group of Pikachu...

239
00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.466
Our 20th year! Congratulations!

240
00:12:56.533 --> 00:12:58.433
It's like a dream, isn't it?

241
00:13:02.633 --> 00:13:04.566
Yee-haw!

242
00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:19.900
Look! Starting today, I run this town!

243
00:13:19.966 --> 00:13:21.233
- Pika.
- What do you mean?

244
00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:24.066
We built this precious little town all ourselves!

245
00:13:24.133 --> 00:13:26.466
And it doesn't belong to you! See?

246
00:13:26.533 --> 00:13:27.833
Pikachu.

247
00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:31.800
2-Get them, now! - Pika!

248
00:13:36.366 --> 00:13:37.466
-Pika.

249
00:13:37.533 --> 00:13:40.033
- Doctor!
- Rock.

250
00:13:41.866 --> 00:13:42.933
- Pi?
- What's going on?

251
00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.900
Who are you?

252
00:13:48.533 --> 00:13:50.600
I refuse to allow your evil deeds!

253
00:13:50.666 --> 00:13:53.600
- It's Super-Pikachu!
- Super?

254
00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:55.400
Pika! Oh!

255
00:13:55.466 --> 00:13:57.300
- Get them!
- Pika, pi!

256
00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:02.166
Stay back! I'll handle this!

257
00:14:02.233 --> 00:14:03.966
Hai-ya!

258
00:14:04.033 --> 00:14:06.700
- Hai-ya!
- Pi! Pi!

259
00:14:06.766 --> 00:14:08.533
Oof!

260
00:14:21.533 --> 00:14:23.966
Now what, Super-Pikachu?

261
00:14:24.033 --> 00:14:25.966
Ah... Scoundrel.

262
00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:28.966
Here, take this!

263
00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.433
Aaah! Aaaah!

264
00:14:34.533 --> 00:14:36.433
- You OK?
- Be strong.

265
00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.800
If you want them back,

266
00:14:39.866 --> 00:14:44.166
come to the top of that mountain all by yourself!

267
00:14:44.233 --> 00:14:46.433
I'll make super-quick work out of you!

268
00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.366
Pikachu!

269
00:14:54.933 --> 00:14:56.933
Oh! Super-Pikachu!

270
00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.666
- Please, stay right here! You must rest!
- Uh! Not possible.

271
00:15:00.733 --> 00:15:03.900
- But you've been injured!
- Super?

272
00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.766
Everyone! Let's follow!

273
00:15:17.233 --> 00:15:20.166
But if we follow, what good will that do?

274
00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.500
-Stop it!

275
00:15:26.566 --> 00:15:28.333
That hurts. Gently, please.

276
00:15:30.333 --> 00:15:31.733
- No more!
- Hm?

277
00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:36.866
I'm alone! So let them go right now!

278
00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.666
You sure are naïve. Too bad!

279
00:15:42.066 --> 00:15:43.466
Pika!

280
00:15:43.533 --> 00:15:46.066
While it's true none of us have super-powers,

281
00:15:46.133 --> 00:15:48.200
or the capability to take flight,

282
00:15:48.266 --> 00:15:52.800
we do have the will to protect our town together!

283
00:15:52.866 --> 00:15:56.200
It's called the power of unity!

284
00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:04.833
Ha, ha. And now it's time to face the fact

285
00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.733
you never had a chance against us!

286
00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.466
- Run, Super, run!
- Don't you worry about us!

287
00:16:11.533 --> 00:16:14.733
I could never do that.

288
00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.533
No matter how beat up this body gets,

289
00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.966
I'll never give up, no matter what!

290
00:16:20.033 --> 00:16:23.233
That's right. Keep talking till you're blue in the face.

291
00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:26.200
Goodbye, Super!

292
00:16:28.766 --> 00:16:31.000
Aah! Waaah!

293
00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.400
Aah!

294
00:16:34.466 --> 00:16:37.300
- Super, are you OK?
- Looks like we made it in time!

295
00:16:37.366 --> 00:16:38.266
Everyone!

296
00:16:38.333 --> 00:16:41.766
Why, you... Hm? No way!

297
00:16:41.833 --> 00:16:44.433
We're rocking together!

298
00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.466
Pikachu!

299
00:16:54.333 --> 00:16:57.466
I won't forget this!

300
00:16:57.533 --> 00:16:59.366
Pika!

301
00:17:02.033 --> 00:17:03.833
- There!
- Thank you, Super!

302
00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:04.833
You saved us!

303
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:08.333
Well then, I'll be on my way! Pika!

304
00:17:12.033 --> 00:17:16.233
And so, the majesty of Super-Pikachu's unrelenting courage,

305
00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:20.800
along with the brave and proud townsfolk, saved Pikachuland.

306
00:17:20.866 --> 00:17:24.466
And they all lived happily ever after!

307
00:17:39.333 --> 00:17:42.266
Pika. Pika!

308
00:17:47.333 --> 00:17:50.266
Pika, pika, pika!

309
00:17:50.333 --> 00:17:52.266
- Pikachu!
- Awesome!

310
00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:54.666
- That was wonderful!
- Denne-ne!

311
00:17:54.733 --> 00:17:57.266
- What a movie!
- I'm such a fan!

312
00:17:57.333 --> 00:18:01.333
Mm! Thank you all. Thank you all.

313
00:18:04.066 --> 00:18:06.800
Director Frank's Pikachu movie is complete!

314
00:18:06.866 --> 00:18:10.233
Filled to the brim with his obvious affection for Pikachu,

315
00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:14.966
this masterpiece is sure to bring smiles to countless children everywhere!

316
00:18:16.133 --> 00:18:19.133
And so, we'll see you at the movies!

317
00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.700
Till then, the balcony is closed...

318
00:18:22.766 --> 00:18:26.033
..as our heroes' journey continues!

319
00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:33.333
And now, the very best of Super-Pikachu's Back-Slapping Bloopers!

320
00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.066
Ready? Action!

321
00:18:35.133 --> 00:18:38.666
Pika! Pika!

322
00:18:38.733 --> 00:18:41.100
- Cut! Too scary!
- Pi?

323
00:18:41.166 --> 00:18:42.466
Pika, pika!

324
00:18:42.533 --> 00:18:45.333
Our 20th year! Congratulations!

325
00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.466
It's like a dream, isn't it?

326
00:18:47.533 --> 00:18:48.633
-Hm?

327
00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.866
What's wrong? Did I mess up?

328
00:18:50.933 --> 00:18:52.700
One more time! Take two!

329
00:18:52.766 --> 00:18:55.866
Our 20th year! Congratulations!

330
00:18:55.933 --> 00:18:57.200
It smells like a dream.

331
00:18:57.266 --> 00:18:59.100
Uh... Oh...

332
00:18:59.166 --> 00:19:02.266
- Are you OK?
- Take three!

333
00:19:02.333 --> 00:19:05.300
- Our 20th congratulations!
- Not yet.

334
00:19:05.366 --> 00:19:07.266
20th congratulations?

335
00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.933
Pika!

336
00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.333
- Pika, ka, ka, ka!
- Pi!

337
00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:19.433
- No, no! Wrong!
- Pika! Pika!

338
00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.800
That's Frank, our director.

339
00:19:21.866 --> 00:19:25.100
He loves Pikachu, and they love him, too!

340
00:19:25.166 --> 00:19:27.433
- Awww.
- Pika!

341
00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:30.500
Jean is our director's trusted assistant.

342
00:19:30.566 --> 00:19:34.433
She can film, do makeup, and a million other things!

343
00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.700
Time for Pikachu's makeup!

344
00:19:36.766 --> 00:19:37.866
I'll do it!

345
00:19:37.933 --> 00:19:40.300
This is how you do the cheeks.

346
00:19:40.366 --> 00:19:42.300
Uh... That may be a bit much.

347
00:19:42.366 --> 00:19:43.433
Pika!

348
00:19:44.766 --> 00:19:46.966
Now, how did that happen?

349
00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.700
That's Clemont. He's in charge of the script.

350
00:19:52.766 --> 00:19:56.500
All right now, regarding this one line... Huh?

351
00:19:56.566 --> 00:19:58.866
I'm Clemont! Hello!

352
00:19:58.933 --> 00:20:00.666
Sorry to bother you.

353
00:20:00.733 --> 00:20:04.466
And this is Ash. He helps everyone with everything.

354
00:20:04.533 --> 00:20:06.666
Hawlu! Hawlucha!

355
00:20:06.733 --> 00:20:08.666
- It's upside down!
- Cha! Cha!

356
00:20:08.733 --> 00:20:11.433
- Pika!
- Pika!

357
00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.500
- Pi... Pika!
- Pika.

358
00:20:13.566 --> 00:20:14.933
Pika, pika.

359
00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.666
Don't worry, Pikachu!

360
00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.866
Cut!

361
00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.633
Lucha. Hawlucha!

362
00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.100
- Pikachu.
- Hawlu?

363
00:20:29.166 --> 00:20:31.166
- Wrong spot, Hawlucha.
- Huh?

364
00:20:31.233 --> 00:20:33.433
Pi...

365
00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:38.500
Pika...

366
00:20:38.566 --> 00:20:39.833
Cut!

367
00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.833
Pika, Pikachu!

368
00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:43.433
That's all, folks!

369
00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.233
Pika!
